{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗚嗚嗚、美羽學姊～～」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sn1715", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「紗凪，稍微冷靜一下啦。妳是想搞砸天羽學姊畢業的氣氛嗎？」", "text_idx": 258, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 298, "voice": "ar4507", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「可是……可是……」", "text_idx": 234, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sn1716", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "美羽學姊的畢業典禮結束後，全體社員都聚在一起祝福她。", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "由於聚餐有點困難，所以大家就決定之後去學姊的家裡慶祝一番了。", "text_idx": 318, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "當然，最後會是我跟學姊兩人獨處……", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「咿咕、咿咕……今天要跟美羽學姊、一直在一起嗚嗚嗚。」", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sn1717", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "嗯，好像沒辦法了。", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔呼呼，雖然畢業了，但我還是會去社團玩的，不要寂寞喔～」", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "mu2473", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我好寂寞。沒有美羽學姊的灰色校園生活……嗚啊啊！」", "text_idx": 251, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sn1718", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "紗凪抱頭痛哭。", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看來這個後遺症還會持續一段時間。", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……哥哥，今天沒有打工嗎？」", "text_idx": 232, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk1347", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，今天排休了。」", "text_idx": 240, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 311, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學園合併正式決定了，今年春天起我們就是「結姬學園」的學生。", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "雖然今年開始有分配到社團經費，但是身為社長，我還是想為了動物們工作。", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊說備品的費用她要出，但我跟紗凪當然是拒絕了。", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不能總是依賴美羽學姊。", "text_idx": 272, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "也是為了讓我們的社團能延續下去。", "text_idx": 274, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哼嗯，你有在打工啊？」", "text_idx": 236, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 298, "voice": "ar4508", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「才剛開始而已。」", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 311, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不久前，我開始在車站前的執事喫茶店打工，一週３天。", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "自己也實際過著這樣的生活後，我再次瞭解到美羽學姊令人敬佩的地方。", "text_idx": 330, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不是被人命令要這麼做。", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以學姊才沒有主動說希望我當社長吧。", "text_idx": 308, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我跟她說了打工的事情後，美羽學姊的表情看起來有點高興又有點煩惱。", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『沒問題的，因為是我自己決定的。』", "text_idx": 266, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 311, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我這樣說之後，學姊突然哭了出來。", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "那是跟與熊喵分別時不同的，帶著笑容的淚水。", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "mu2474", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "而且現在，那個人依然帶著不變的笑容在我身邊。", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我們約好明年我畢業的時候就同居。", "text_idx": 304, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不過在那之前我也會經常前往學姊的家，兩人相處的時間應該不會減少太多。", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "讓大家擔心了。", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "瀨名同學、安潔、櫻乃、隼太、還有紗凪……", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果沒有大家，就沒有現在的我和美羽學姊。", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊一定也是這麼想的。", "text_idx": 288, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──不是一個人，有大家在。", "text_idx": 228, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "還有熊喵也在守護著我們。", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好了，我們也差不多該走了吧？」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sn1720", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「說的也是。」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "愛理", "alt_speaker_idx": 298, "voice": "ar4510", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "櫻乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 314, "voice": "sk1349", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「遵命！」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "安潔", "alt_speaker_idx": 293, "voice": "ag3470", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯？要去學姊家的話，大家一起……」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 311, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我才說到一半，所有人就動作一致地搖頭。", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看來是在體貼我們。", "text_idx": 321, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "直到最近我才注意到。", "text_idx": 320, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "一開始讓我呼吸困難的這所學園的空氣，不知不覺中已經變得如此舒適。", "text_idx": 269, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "森林的氣味，以及融洽的人們的溫度。", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好像隨處可見但並不是。", "text_idx": 284, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "這裡，這所學園，有想要保護的重要東西。", "text_idx": 336, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……喂，新吾。」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sn1722", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然後，新交到的我的『好友』──", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sn1723", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "自然地對上視線。", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她率先露出了笑容。", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我們是很忙的。只剩下今天能親熱了喔！」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sn1724", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "然後她颯爽地轉身。", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「明天開始，你就要以環境保護社的社長身分開始忙了。」", "text_idx": 254, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "紗凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 324, "voice": "sn1725", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「紗凪……」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 311, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "紗凪走在所有人的前方。", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她沒有注意到吧。", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『……結果，雖然我沒辦法成為像美羽學姊那樣的人。』", "text_idx": 265, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "說了那樣的話的她。", "text_idx": 334, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "挺直的背和美羽學姊一樣，堅強而溫柔。", "text_idx": 310, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊也信任地看著她。", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以我也目送著那個背影直到看不見大家。", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "mu2477", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "確認四周沒有其他人在看後，學姊牽起我的手。", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "像這樣穿著制服相處的日子，今天是最後一天了。", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "其實，我還想跟學姊一起度過校園生活的。", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "想跟她兩個人，在這個地方創造更多的回憶。", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果能更早一點跟美羽學姊相遇的話……」", "text_idx": 245, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 311, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "mu2478", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 311, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果能更早相遇的話？」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "mu2479", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊有點壞心眼地笑著問。", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她一定明白。", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我們兩人的「答案」是一樣的。", "text_idx": 302, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……不，就算更早相遇結果也會是相同的。」", "text_idx": 230, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 311, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，相同呢♪」", "text_idx": 242, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "mu2480", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "還是會兩個人一起迎來今天這個日子。", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "與學姊之間的回憶，今後也能繼續創造。", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "但是，只有一件事。", "text_idx": 275, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "如果真的有神明存在的話。", "text_idx": 286, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "mu2481", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "希望能讓這個望著遠方森林的人，有機會與熊喵創造回憶。", "text_idx": 295, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "再一次就好，希望能讓她能抱抱熊喵。", "text_idx": 278, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……再見了，小熊喵。」", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "mu2482", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「！？」", "text_idx": 264, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 311, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "小聲的道別之後，美羽學姊深深吸了一口氣。", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小熊喵，要保重喔──────！」", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "mu2483", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "彷彿山谷間的回音。", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也大喊了出來。", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "與其向神明祈求，這個人的心意……", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「熊喵，保重喔────────！！」", "text_idx": 256, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 311, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她的心意一定能傳達給熊喵。", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「走吧，新吾君！」", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "mu2484", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的。」", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 311, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "學姊神采奕奕地邁出步伐。", "text_idx": 291, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我們交握的手大大的擺盪。", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「對了對了，我有件事想拜託新吾君。」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "mu2485", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎麼了？」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 311, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯，就是啊……」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "mu2486", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我們不會再停滯不前……", "text_idx": 300, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我們朝著前方邁進，偶爾兩個人一起回頭重溫走過的路。", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我想跟新吾君一起……今後，被許多貓咪們圍繞著生活。」", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "mu2487", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「跟重要的你。」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "mu2488", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route03_01.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「跟最喜歡的孩子們一起，永遠、永遠──」", "text_idx": 261, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 327, "voice": "mu2489", "char_id": "みう"}]}
